# The photographs of the paper notebook are deliberately NOT in version
# control: the inside cover carries a home address. Keep them locally if
# you want to check a transcription against the page, but they stay out
# of the repository. data/notebook-source.yaml records what was on them.
notebook/
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic

# The two PDFs under build/ are committed so the QR code on the cover leads
# somewhere readable without anyone installing LaTeX. Everything else in
# there is a build intermediate and is regenerated by `make`.
build/*
!build/voicings-screen.pdf
!build/voicings-print.pdf

*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
